{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "会话习惯(2026-09-24):大数 = 平均一次会话持续多久(会话里有动静的时长,不是开着窗口的时长);下面 = 最长一次、今天与近 7 天的会话数。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "会话习惯",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "h": " 小时 ",
        "m": " 分",
        "sub": "平均每次会话",
        "max": "最长一次 ",
        "today": "今天 ",
        "d7": " 次 · 近 7 天 ",
        "times": " 次"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Sessions",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "h": "h ",
        "m": "m",
        "sub": "Average session",
        "max": "Longest ",
        "today": "Today ",
        "d7": " · 7 days ",
        "times": ""
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "会话习惯(2026-09-24):大数 = 平均一次会话持续多久(会话里有动静的时长,不是开着窗口的时长);下面 = 最长一次、今天与近 7 天的会话数。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.sess.am}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[if::(gt::(${w.sess.ah},0),${w.sess.ah}${@i18n.h},)]${w.sess.am}${@i18n.m}",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.sess.am}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+6.6pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+27pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.sub}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-50pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#EFE5E1|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.sess.xm}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-42pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.max}$[if::(gt::(${w.sess.xh},0),${w.sess.xh}${@i18n.h},)]${w.sess.xm}${@i18n.m}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-26pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.today}${w.sess.today}${@i18n.d7}${w.sess.d7}${@i18n.times}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.sess.xm}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-42pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.max}--",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-26pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.today}--${@i18n.d7}--${@i18n.times}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "times"
    ]
  }
}